diff --git a/docs/api/sections/notifications.md b/docs/api/sections/notifications.md
index 6bddff1..08f2999 100644
--- a/docs/api/sections/notifications.md
+++ b/docs/api/sections/notifications.md
@@ -96,3 +96,31 @@ __Request:__
 __Response:__
 
 Returns `204 No Content` on success.
+
+## `POST /:account_slug/users/:user_id/push_subscriptions`
+
+Registers a browser's push subscription for the current user, so that whatever lands in their notification tray is also pushed to that device. Pass along the subscription the browser got from its push service, as returned by `PushSubscription.toJSON()`. Registering the same subscription again is harmless.
+
+Only the current user can register subscriptions for themselves. Pushes are signed with the instance's VAPID key pair, whose public key is what the browser has to subscribe with.
+
+| Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
+|-----------|------|----------|-------------|
+| `endpoint` | string | Yes | The push service URL for this subscription |
+| `p256dh_key` | string | Yes | The subscription's `p256dh` key, base64url encoded |
+| `auth_key` | string | Yes | The subscription's `auth` secret, base64url encoded |
+
+__Request:__
+
+```json
+{
+  "push_subscription": {
+    "endpoint": "https://fcm.googleapis.com/fcm/send/dpH5lCsTSSM:APA91bH...",
+    "p256dh_key": "BNcRdreALRFXTkOOUHK1EtK2wtaz5Ry4YfYCA_0QTpQtUbVlUls0VJXg7A8u-Ts1XbjhazAkj7I99e8QcYP7DkM=",
+    "auth_key": "tBHItJI5svbpez7KI4CCXg=="
+  }
+}
+```
+
+__Response:__
+
+Returns `201 Created` on success.
